   "speaker_id": "spk_mara_vey",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m03_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Three districts, one reserve, and less margin than the gauges admit. We bring them back in the order we inherited, not the order we would argue for.",
